            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>11</code> lebih besar dari atau sama dengan <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>&gt;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kedua angka itu sama. Bentuk operatornya agar kode menampilkan <code>True</code> di sini, dan tetap menampilkan <code>True</code> jika angka di kiri lebih besar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>&gt;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
